    user_requests: "start prompt\nRole: Senior Fullstack Developer & UI/UX Specialist.\nGoal: Build a \"Production & Multi-Kitchen Module\" with a deep focus on widget-level detail for every page.\n\n1. GLOBAL UI SYSTEM\n\nColor Palette: Primary (#4F46E5 - Indigo 600), Background (#F8FAFC - Slate 50), Text (#1E293B - Slate 800).\n\nCorner Radius: rounded-2xl (16px) for cards, rounded-lg (8px) for buttons/inputs.\n\nShadows: shadow-sm for default cards, shadow-md for hover states.\n\nComponents: Use framer-motion for page transitions and modal entries.\n\n2. PAGE & WIDGET SPECIFICATIONS\n\nPAGE A: ADMIN - MONITORING DASHBOARD\n\nWidget: Stat Cards Row\n\n4 Cards: \"Total Dapur Aktif\", \"Porsi Sukses Hari Ini\", \"Porsi Sedang Dimasak\", \"Koki Bertugas\".\n\nUI: Icon Lucide di kiri, Label di atas, Value (Bold) di bawah.\n\nWidget: Live Cooking Activity Feed\n\nList vertikal berisi kartu aktivitas.\n\nUI: Foto Menu (small circle), Nama Menu, Nama Dapur, Badge Status (Preparing: Yellow, Cooking: Indigo, Ready: Green/Selesai).\n\nInteraction: Animasi \"Pulse\" pada badge jika sedang \"Cooking\".\n\nWidget: Daily Progress Chart\n\nBar chart sederhana menunjukkan target porsi vs realisasi per jam.\n\nAction: Link History Produksi\n\nTombol navigasi di pojok kanan dashboard untuk mengakses tabel histori seluruh produksi masa lalu.\n\nPAGE B: ADMIN - PERENCANAAN PRODUKSI\n\nWidget: Weekly Production Calendar (7-Day Grid)\n\nGrid horizontal 7 kolom (Senin-Minggu).\n\nUI Card di dalam grid: Nama Dapur & Nama Menu.\n\nLogic Alert: Jika stok di inventory_batches < kebutuhan resep, Card berubah menjadi Border Red + BG Light Red.\n\nInteraction: Klik Card Merah memicu \"Request Stock Modal\".\n\nWidget: Request Stock Modal\n\nForm untuk meminta bahan ke gudang pusat.\n\nField: Nama Bahan (Auto-filled), Jumlah Kekurangan, Urgensi (Normal/Urgent).\n\nWidget: Production Form Modal\n\nField: Select Menu, Select Dapur, Input Date, Select Shift.\n\nSub-Widget: Live Material Preview: List di sisi kanan form.\n\nBehavior: Kalkulasi bahan dan peringatan \"Stok Kurang\" hanya akan muncul setelah user menekan tombol ENTER pada input jumlah porsi.\n\nPAGE C: ADMIN - DETAIL DAPUR (THE TABS)\n\nHeader Widget:\n\nElemen: Tombol Kembali, Judul Dapur, Alamat, Progress Bar Kapasitas.\n\nDropdown Selection: Button dropdown untuk berpindah review ke dapur lain tanpa kembali ke halaman daftar.\n\nWidget: Tab Switcher: Navigation Underlined (Staff, Shift, Stok).\n\nTab Staff - Widget: Employee Table:\n\nKolom: Avatar, Nama, Role Badge, Status Aktif, Aksi (Edit, Delete).\n\nTombol \"Tambah Staff\" di kanan atas yang memicu Modal Form.\n\nTab Shift - Widget: Shift Schedule Card:\n\n2 Kartu (Pagi & Siang). Isi: Jam Kerja, Total Staf assigned, Avatar Stack staf bertugas.\n\nTab Stok - Widget: Kitchen Stock Monitor:\n\nList bahan baku utama dengan progress bar volume.\n\nGranular Dropdown: Setiap bahan bisa di-klik untuk drop-down detail per wadah (Contoh: \"Box A1 - Ayam - 5 kg - Exp: 20/05/2024\").\n\nPAGE D: ADMIN - LAPORAN WASTAGE NASIONAL\n\nWidget: Wastage Summary Chart\n\nPie chart atau Bar chart yang menunjukkan persentase bahan terbuang berdasarkan alasan (Expired vs Human Error).\n\nWidget: Global Wastage Table\n\nDaftar record kerugian dari seluruh dapur untuk audit efisiensi.\n\nPAGE E: CHEF - ANTREAN MASAK\n\nWidget: Cooking Queue Card (Large Target)\n\nFokus: Nama Menu (X-Large), Jumlah Porsi, Shift Penanggung Jawab.\n\nAction: Button \"Mulai Persiapan\" atau \"Selesai Masak\".\n\nWidget: QA & Handover Modal (Triggered on Finish)\n\nInput: Suhu Akhir (Numeric), Catatan QA (Textarea).\n\nSub-Widget: Return Stock Input: List bahan yang digunakan, koki menginput sisa berat (misal: \"Sisa Garam 200g\") untuk update akurasi stok.\n\nWidget: Handover Generator\n\nMenampilkan ID Produksi dan QR Code untuk diserahkan ke kurir logistik.\n\nPAGE F: CHEF - STOK DAPUR GRANULAR\n\nWidget: Granular Stock Table\n\nKolom: Nama Bahan, Tipe Wadah, Berat, Tanggal Kadaluarsa.\n\nFEFO Logic: Sortir otomatis kadaluarsa terdekat di atas dengan label \"Gunakan Segera\".\n\nWidget: Wastage Report Modal\n\nForm: Pilih Batch spesifik, Input Berat Dibuang, Alasan (Busuk/Kadaluarsa).\n\n3. BACKEND INTEGRATION REQUIREMENTS\n\nInventory Logic: Update otomatis tabel inventory_batches saat Chef melakukan \"Return Stock\".\n\nNotification Service: Kirim sinyal ke Dashboard Admin jika ada laporan Wastage atau Request Stok baru.\n\nRBAC: Pastikan middleware membatasi akses: Admin (All Pages), Chef (Hanya Page E & F).\n\nOutput: Generate file Controller, Routes, dan React Components lengkap dengan instruksi npm install library yang dibutuhkan.\nend prompt\n\naku mau kamu pahami konteks dari project yg akan dibuat"
    user_requests: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\n  <title>Production & Multi-Kitchen Control Center</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root {\\n      --primary: #4F46E5;\\n      --primary-dark: #3730A3;\\n      --bg: #F8FAFC;\\n      --text-main: #1E293B;\\n      --text-muted: #64748B;\\n      --white: #FFFFFF;\\n      --success: #22C55E;\\n      --warning: #F59E0B;\\n      --border: #E2E8F0;\\n      --radius-xl: 16px;\\n      --radius-lg: 8px;\\n      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\\n      --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\\n    }\\n\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    body {\\n      font-family: \'Inter\', -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n      background-color: var(--bg);\\n      color: var(--text-main);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      width: 1024px;\\n      height: 768px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Layout */\\n    .top-nav {\\n      height: 64px;\\n      background: var(--white);\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      padding: 0 24px;\\n      flex-shrink: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .main-container {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex: 1;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    .sidebar {\\n      width: 240px;\\n      background: var(--white);\\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\\n      padding: 24px 16px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .dashboard-content {\\n      flex: 1;\\n      padding: 24px;\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;\\n      gap: 24px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Navigation Items */\\n    .nav-link {\\n      padding: 12px 16px;\\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      text-decoration: none;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      font-weight: 500;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-link.active {\\n      background: #EEF2FF;\\n      color: var(--primary);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Stats Widget */\\n    .stats-row {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\\n      gap: 20px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .stat-card {\\n      background: var(--white);\\n      padding: 20px;\\n      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);\\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\\n    }\\n\\n    .stat-icon {\\n      width: 48px;\\n      height: 48px;\\n      background: #EEF2FF;\\n      border-radius: 12px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      color: var(--primary);\\n    }\\n\\n    .stat-label {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .stat-value {\\n      font-size: 20px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Grid Content */\\n    .dashboard-grid {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;\\n      gap: 24px;\\n      min-height: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .widget-panel {\\n      background: var(--white);\\n      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);\\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    .widget-header {\\n      padding: 16px 20px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      align-items: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .widget-title {\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Activity List */\\n    .activity-list {\\n      padding: 0;\\n      list-style: none;\\n      overflow-y: auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    .activity-item {\\n      padding: 16px 20px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .menu-thumb {\\n      width: 40px;\\n      height: 40px;\\n      background: #E2E8F0;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      flex-shrink: 0;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      font-weight: bold;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    .activity-info {\\n      flex: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    .menu-name {\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n    }\\n\\n    .kitchen-name {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    .badge {\\n      padding: 4px 10px;\\n      border-radius: 99px;\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n\\n    .badge-preparing { background: #FEF3C7; color: #92400E; }\\n    .badge-cooking { background: #EEF2FF; color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid #C7D2FE; }\\n    .badge-ready { background: #DCFCE7; color: #166534; }\\n\\n    /* Mock Chart */\\n    .chart-container {\\n      padding: 20px;\\n      flex: 1;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: flex-end;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      height: 200px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .chart-bar-group {\\n      flex: 1;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .bar-stack {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column-reverse;\\n      height: 140px;\\n      background: #F1F5F9;\\n      border-radius: 4px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    .bar-value {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      background: var(--primary);\\n      border-top-left-radius: 4px;\\n      border-top-right-radius: 4px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .chart-label {\\n      font-size: 10px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    .history-btn {\\n      margin-top: auto;\\n      padding: 16px;\\n      background: #F1F5F9;\\n      text-align: center;\\n      color: var(--primary);\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      text-decoration: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .history-btn:hover { background: #E2E8F0; }\\n\\n    /* Profile Widget */\\n    .user-profile {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .avatar {\\n      width: 32px;\\n      height: 32px;\\n      background: var(--primary);\\n      color: white;\\n      border-radius: 8px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      font-weight: bold;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n  <nav class=\\\"top-nav\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"background:var(--primary); width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:8px;\\\"></div>\\n      <h1 style=\\\"font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\\\">Kitchen<span style=\\\"color:var(--primary);\\\">Flow</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"user-profile\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:600;\\\">Admin Production</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted);\\\">Central Command</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">AD</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"main-container\\\">\\n    <aside clas