    thinking: "**Troubleshooting The White Screen**\n\nI\'ve been battling that blasted white screen and have eliminated several potential culprits. First, I exorcised both `motion/react` and `recharts` from the codebase. Then, I simplified the routing logic, and added explicit `index.html` transformations in the dev server, along with console logs for good measure. No luck yet, but I\'m narrowing it down.\n\n\n**Analyzing Server Asset Delivery**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the server-side asset delivery. I\'ve been reviewing `server.ts` to ensure `index.html` is being served correctly and that there are no issues in the Vite transformation pipeline. I added `console.log` and `document.title` changes in `main.tsx`, and removed all `@/` path aliases, using relative paths instead. I forced `process.env.NODE_ENV = \'development\'` for good measure. I also simplified `index.css` and added then removed a fallback text, and user screenshots have provided some relevant information as well.\n\n\n**Investigating Vite Configuration**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving deeper into the `server.ts` file again, focusing on the Vite integration order. I suspect an issue with request handling. I should try a bare-bones `App.tsx` component to rule out complex code. I also will try running `lint_applet` to look for simple errors. I have also decided to review the `vite.config.ts` file next.\n\n\n"
