  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 5
    user_intent: "Debugging White Screen Issue\nThe user\'s primary goal is to resolve a persistent white screen issue that is preventing the application from rendering in the preview environment. This involves systematically troubleshooting and removing potentially conflicting libraries and code, such as Framer Motion, Recharts, and complex routing, to isolate the root cause and restore basic UI functionality. The user is also focused on ensuring the development server and build process are correctly configured to serve the application."
    session_summary: "# Summary for Seamless Resumption of Work\n\nThis document summarizes the conversation and actions taken to address the user\'s objective of applying the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the \"Production & Multi-Kitchen Module\" and resolving a persistent blank white screen issue.\n\n## User Objective:\nTheme Application & Bug Fixing for the \"Production & Multi-Kitchen Module\".\n\n## Key Information and Context:\n\n*   **Project Setup**: Vite build tool, React frontend, mock Express.js server (`server.ts`).\n*   **Design System (\"Professional Polish\")**:\n    *   **Color Palette**: Primary (#4F46E5), Background (#F8FAFC), Text (#1E293B), Muted Text (#64748B), Success (#22C55E), Warning (#F59E0B), Border (#E2E8F0).\n    *   **Corner Radius**: `rounded-2xl` (16px) for cards, `rounded-lg` (8px) for buttons/inputs.\n    *   **Shadows**: `shadow-sm` for default, `shadow-md` for hover states.\n    *   **Typography**: Inter font family (though simplified in `index.css` to system fonts for debugging).\n    *   **Animations**: Framer Motion (`motion`) was initially intended but has been systematically removed for debugging.\n*   **Module Structure**: Admin and Chef sections with various pages.\n*   **Core Components**: `Shell`, `Card`, `Button`, `Badge`, `Modal`.\n*   **Key Libraries**: `react`, `react-router-dom`, `tailwindcss`, `lucide-react`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, `vite`, `express`.\n*   **Chart Libraries**: `recharts` (initially used, now commented out/removed for debugging).\n\n## Features Modified, Added, or Removed:\n\n*   **Animations**: All instances of `framer-motion` and `motion` have been removed from `Card.tsx`, `Badge.tsx`, `Modal.tsx`, `KitchenDetail.tsx`, and `Dashboard.tsx`.\n*   **Chart Libraries**: `recharts` has been commented out in `Dashboard.tsx` and `WastageReport.tsx`, and replaced with static placeholders.\n*   **Routing**: Nested routes in `App.tsx` were flattened, and the `App.tsx` component was simplified to a bare-bones rendering test case.\n*   **Server Configuration**:\n    *   `server.ts` was updated to explicitly handle `index.html` transformation via Vite in development mode.\n    *   API routes were differentiated from general routes to ensure correct `index.html` serving.\n    *   `process.env.NODE_ENV` is explicitly set to `\'development\'`.\n*   **Global Styles**: `index.css` was simplified to a minimal baseline.\n*   **Initial HTML**: The temporary \"Initializing KitchenPro System...\" message in `index.html` was removed.\n*   **Entry Point Diagnostics**: `main.tsx` was modified to log the mounting process and set `document.title` to \"System Active\" as a diagnostic marker.\n\n## Dependencies and APIs:\n\n*   **Dependencies**: `react`, `react-dom`, `react-router-dom`, `tailwindcss`, `autoprefixer`, `lucide-react`, `date-fns`, `motion` (removed), `recharts` (commented out/removed), `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, `vite`, `express`, `@types/express`.\n*   **APIs**: Mock API service defined in `services/api.ts` and mock data within `server.ts`.\n\n## Design Decisions:\n\n*   The \"Professional Polish\" theme is the target aesthetic.\n*   Animations and complex charting libraries were temporarily disabled to isolate the blank screen bug.\n*   The application\'s core structure and routing were simplified for debugging.\n\n## Environmental Variables:\n\n*   `process.env.NODE_ENV` is explicitly set to `\'development\'` in `server.ts`.\n\n## Security Preferences:\n\n*   Not explicitly discussed, but standard practices are assumed.\n\n## Special User Requests and Preferences:\n\n*   Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme.\n*   Resolve the blank white screen issue.\n\n## Existing Blockers and Bugs:\n\n*   **Persistent Blank White Screen**: This was the primary issue addressed. Despite multiple attempts, the application preview remained blank. The root cause was likely a combination of complex rendering logic, animation library conflicts, and potentially incorrect Vite middleware configuration in the specific preview environment.\n*   **Path Alias Resolution Errors**: Resolved by converting to relative paths and removing problematic Vite alias configurations.\n*   **CSS Compilation Issues**: Resolved by fixing invalid Tailwind classes and simplifying global styles.\n\n## Next Steps:\n\n1.  **Re-introduce Core Functionality**:\n    *   Restore the original routing structure in `App.tsx`.\n    *   Re-introduce the `Shell` component and its associated logic.\n    *   Gradually re-introduce components and pages, starting with `AdminDashboard.tsx`.\n2.  **Re-integrate Libraries Incrementally**:\n    *   Once the core application renders, re-introduce `recharts` to `Dashboard.tsx` and `WastageReport.tsx`, testing after each addition.\n    *   Re-introduce `framer-motion` and `AnimatePresence` step-by-step, starting with simpler components like `Modal.tsx` and `Card.tsx`, then moving to page transitions in `App.tsx` and `KitchenDetail.tsx`. Test thoroughly after each re-introduction.\n3.  **Full Theme Application Verification**: Conduct a final visual inspection of all pages and components to ensure adherence to the \"Professional Polish\" design.\n4.  **API Integration Check**: Verify all data fetching and display are functional.\n5.  **Code Linting and Formatting**: Run final linting and formatting checks.\n\nThis comprehensive summary should provide all necessary context to resume development effectively."
    code_change_summary: "<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/App.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>6-61</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Replaced the entire application structure with a minimal, static HTML display to verify if React can mount any content at all, decoupling the issue from routing and component logic.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/main.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>3-9</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Added a console log and a document title update to confirm JavaScript execution and successful mounting of the React app.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/index.html</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>6-11</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Removed the temporary \"Initializing KitchenPro System...\" message from the #root div to ensure a clean render of the application\'s core content.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/server.ts</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>103-112</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Modified the Vite middleware configuration to explicitly handle non-API routes by transforming index.html, ensuring correct serving of the SPA entry point in development.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/index.css</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>1-25</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Stripped down global CSS to a minimal baseline, removing Tailwind theme variables and complex layer rules to rule out CSS parsing or compilation issues.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/pages/admin/KitchenDetail.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>9-10;111-112;119-120;175-176;237-238;294-336</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Removed all Framer Motion imports and usages (`motion`, `AnimatePresence`) from the component to isolate potential conflicts with the animation library.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/pages/admin/Dashboard.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>7-7;8